 cost.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Bant Panorama: Search your library for a basic Forest, Plains, or Island card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity. If you spend this mana to cast your commander, it enters the battlefield with a number of additional +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number of times it's been cast from the command zone this game.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Molten Slagheap.\n{1}, Remove X storage counters from Molten Slagheap: Add X mana in any combination of {B} and/or {R}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Saltcrusted Steppe.\n{1}, Remove X storage counters from Saltcrusted Steppe: Add X mana in any combination of {G} and/or {W}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Haunted Fengraf: Return a creature card at random from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Gargoyle Castle: Create a 3/4 colorless Gargoyle artifact creature token with flying.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}, Sacrifice Crystal Vein: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}, Sacrifice Ghost Quarter: Destroy target land. Its controller may search their library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 1 life.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}. Activate only if you control a Swamp.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {G} for each Elf on the battlefield.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Add {W} or {U}.\n{W}{U}: Azorius Keyrune becomes a 2/2 white and blue Bird artifact creature with flying until end of turn.', '{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature for each Elf you control.', '{T}: Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of Elves on the battlefield.', '{T}: Target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', '{T}: You gain 1 life for each Elf on the battlefield.', "{W}, Sacrifice Soul Snare: Exile target creature that's attacking you or a planeswalker you control."]
